msgid ""
"There were {} of {} ancestors ({}) found.\n"
"Only individual ancestors were counted. Duplicates caused by pedigree "
"collapse were ignored."
msgstr ""
"Il y avait {} des {} ancêtres ({}) trouvés.\n"
"Seuls les ancêtres individuels ont été pris en compte. Les doublons causés "
"par l’effondrement du pedigree ont été ignorés."
